---
title: "Actividades Extraescolares 2026-2027"
permalink: /extraescolares/
layout: layouts/page.njk
icon: "⚽"
navLabel: "Extraescolares"
navOrder: 2
showInNav: true
iconColor: "gold"
---

<p>{{ extraescolares.intro }}</p>

<p>{{ extraescolares.subintro }}</p>

{# ===== CADRO DE HORARIOS OFICIAL ===== #}
<div class="schedule-card">
  <div class="schedule-card__header">
    <h3 class="schedule-card__title">Horario Xeral Extraescolares <span class="heading-year">({{ extraescolares.academic_year }})</span></h3>
    <a href="{{ extraescolares.schedule_image }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="schedule-card__action">Ver horario completo</a>
  </div>
  <div class="schedule-card__scroll">
    <a href="{{ extraescolares.schedule_image }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
      <img src="{{ extraescolares.schedule_image }}" alt="Horario xeral de actividades extraescolares {{ extraescolares.academic_year }}" class="schedule-card__img">
    </a>
  </div>
  <span class="schedule-card__hint">Despraza en horizontal para ver todas as columnas ou pulsa para ampliar.</span>
</div>

<p>{{ extraescolares.deadlines_note }}</p>

{# ===== ALTA DE SOCIO E MATRÍCULA ===== #}
<div class="callout-box">
  <h3>{{ extraescolares.membership.title }}</h3>
  <p>{{ extraescolares.membership.non_member_note }}</p>
  <div class="callout-box__actions">
    <a href="{{ extraescolares.membership.join_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-action">{{ extraescolares.membership.join_label }}</a>
    <a href="{{ extraescolares.membership.non_member_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-action">{{ extraescolares.membership.non_member_label }}</a>
  </div>
</div>

{# ===== LISTADO DE ACTIVIDADES ===== #}
<h2>Listado de actividades e inscricións</h2>

<div class="activity-cards">
  {% for act in extraescolares.activities %}
  <article class="activity-card" id="act-{{ act.id }}">
    <div class="activity-card__header">
      <h3 class="activity-card__title">{{ act.name }}</h3>
      {% if act.status == 'full' %}
        <span class="status-badge status-badge--full">Completa</span>
      {% elif act.status == 'partial' %}
        <span class="status-badge status-badge--partial">Parcialmente completa</span>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
    <div class="activity-card__details">
      <span class="activity-card__detail-item"><strong>Etapa:</strong> {{ act.stage }}</span>
      <span class="activity-card__detail-item"><strong>Prezo:</strong> {{ act.price }}</span>
      {% if act.provider %}
      <span class="activity-card__detail-item"><strong>Imparte:</strong> {{ act.provider }}</span>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
    {% if act.status_note %}
    <p class="activity-card__note{% if act.status == 'full' %} activity-card__note--full{% elif act.status == 'partial' %} activity-card__note--partial{% endif %}">
      {{ act.status_note }}
    </p>
    {% endif %}
    {% set has_reg = (act.status != 'full' and act.registration_url) %}
    {% set has_email = (act.contact_email and '@' in act.contact_email and not (' ' in act.contact_email.trim())) %}
    {% if has_reg or has_email %}
    <div class="activity-card__actions">
      {% if has_reg %}
      <a href="{{ act.registration_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-action">
        {{ act.button_label or 'Inscrición' }}
      </a>
      {% endif %}
      {% if has_email %}
      <a href="mailto:{{ act.contact_email | trim | urlencode }}" class="btn-action btn-action--secondary">
        Contactar por email
      </a>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
    {% endif %}
  </article>
  {% endfor %}
</div>

{# ===== CADRO DE TARIFAS ===== #}
<h2>Cadro de tarifas e cotas <span class="heading-year">({{ extraescolares.academic_year }})</span></h2>
<p>É necesaria a alta como socio/a da ANPA para acceder a estas tarifas. As actividades de carácter xeral teñen un prezo de <strong>22 € / 2 horas semanais</strong>, agás aquelas con custos específicos de material ou monitores homologados.</p>

<div class="pricing-table-container">
  <table class="pricing-table">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th scope="col">Actividade</th>
        <th scope="col">Horas</th>
        <th scope="col">Cota mensual</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in extraescolares.pricing_table %}
      <tr>
        <td><strong>{{ item.name }}</strong></td>
        <td>{{ item.hours }}</td>
        <td>{{ item.price }}</td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

{# ===== CONDICIÓNS XERAIS E CONVIVENCIA ===== #}
<h2>Condicións xerais e réxime de convivencia</h2>

<details class="conditions-accordion">
  <summary>Condicións xerais do servizo de actividades extraescolares</summary>
  <div class="conditions-accordion__content">
    <ol>
      {% for cond in extraescolares.general_conditions %}
      <li>
        <strong>{{ cond.title }}:</strong>
        {% if cond.paragraphs %}
          {% for p in cond.paragraphs %}
            {% if loop.first %}
              {{ p }}
            {% else %}
              <p class="conditions-subtext">{{ p }}</p>
            {% endif %}
          {% endfor %}
        {% else %}
          {{ cond.text }}
        {% endif %}

        {% if cond.options %}
        <ul class="conditions-options">
          {% for opt in cond.options %}
          <li>{{ opt }}</li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
        {% endif %}

        {% if cond.extra_text %}
        <p class="conditions-extra-text">{{ cond.extra_text }}</p>
        {% endif %}

        {% if cond.subheading %}
        <p class="conditions-subheading"><strong>{{ cond.subheading }}</strong></p>
        {% endif %}

        {% if cond.sub_items %}
        <ul class="conditions-sub-items">
          {% for item in cond.sub_items %}
          <li>{{ item }}</li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
        {% endif %}

        {% if cond.statement %}
        <p class="conditions-statement"><strong>{{ cond.statement }}</strong></p>
        {% endif %}
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ol>
  </div>
</details>

<details class="conditions-accordion">
  <summary>{{ extraescolares.coexistence_articles.title }}</summary>
  <div class="conditions-accordion__content">
    <h4>{{ extraescolares.coexistence_articles.article_65.title }}</h4>
    <p>{{ extraescolares.coexistence_articles.article_65.intro }}</p>
    <ul>
      {% for point in extraescolares.coexistence_articles.article_65.points %}
      <li>{{ point }}</li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>

    <h4>{{ extraescolares.coexistence_articles.article_66.title }}</h4>
    <p>{{ extraescolares.coexistence_articles.article_66.intro }}</p>
    <ul>
      {% for point in extraescolares.coexistence_articles.article_66.points %}
      <li>{{ point }}</li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</details>

<p>
  <img src="{{ extraescolares.corresponsables_image or '/img/extraescolares-corresponsables.jpg' }}" alt="{{ extraescolares.corresponsables_image_alt or 'Plan Corresponsables - Xunta de Galicia' }}">
</p>
